# Entropy-Robinhood-Lighter-Arbitrage credentials
#
#   cp .env.example .env     then fill in
#
# Required to trade (the bot is live-only). Only --record-only data
# collection runs without credentials.
# NEVER commit .env to git.

# ===== Entropy — Hyperliquid (always required to trade) =====
# Create an API/agent wallet at https://app.hyperliquid.xyz/API — put the
# AGENT wallet's private key here and your main account address below.
HL_PRIVATE_KEY=
HL_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS=

# ===== --hedge tradexyz (optional overrides) =====
# tradexyz shares the Hyperliquid account above by default. To trade it from
# a separate account/agent key, set these:
#HL_PRIVATE_KEY_XYZ=
#HL_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS_XYZ=

# ===== --hedge lighter or --hedge lighter-rh =====
# Register an API key for the SAME deployment as your --hedge flag
# (mainnet and the Robinhood chain are separate accounts and separate keys).
# See https://github.com/elliottech/lighter-python for key setup.
LIGHTER_ACCOUNT_INDEX=
LIGHTER_API_KEY_INDEX=
LIGHTER_API_PRIVATE_KEY=
